{
  "_notes": [
    "Every path is relative to the output folder passed as --root.",
    "Every word in 'content' comes from the user. The placeholders below show structure only.",
    "x and y are fractions of the canvas: x is the centre for centred text and the left edge for left-aligned text; y is the vertical centre.",
    "fontSize is in Palmier canvas points: rendered pixels on a 1080x1920 reel = fontSize x 1.78.",
    "camera.move is one of: none, pan-left, pan-right, push-in, pull-out, drift-up. camera.amount is the zoom headroom, 0.05 to 0.14.",
    "grade is optional: exposure (-3 to 3 EV), contrast (0.5 to 1.5), saturation (0 to 2), temperature (kelvin, 6500 neutral).",
    "A text block with 'start' appears partway through (frame number at 30fps; 129 is 4.3 seconds).",
    "Images: 'size' places a square (icons); 'w' and 'h' in canvas pixels place any other shape, such as a screenshot card. Match w:h to the image's own aspect ratio or it stretches.",
    "Keep every overlay on screen from frame 0 unless the user asks for a line to appear later; the movement comes from the footage."
